          <p class="text-amber-800 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            NordicTrack runs frequent sales, especially around major
            holidays. If you're not in a rush, watch the price for a few
            weeks — it's common to see the X9i drop $150-$300 below its
            typical street price during promotional periods, making it an
            even easier recommendation.
          </p>
